###############################################################################
# Q10 -- Benchmark results (Q11 inference-cost properties inline)
###############################################################################

# No energy/force/stress accuracy metric is reported in a form the schema captures (see Q12).

###############################################################################
# Q11 -- Computational resources
###############################################################################

# Geometry optimisations with the fine-tuned committees typically took 2
# min per polymorph on NVIDIA A100 GPUs. NVE and NVT simulations used
# replicated cells of about 25 A (1,104 to 2,944 atoms). The fine-tuned
# models have 752,174 parameters. No training time is given.

###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Training errors: the text states MAEs of approximately 7 meV/A (forces) and around 2 meV/atom (energies) for all three committees together; the per-committee values are only in Fig. 4a and the split (training or validation) is not stated, so no metric is encoded.
# - The paper is inconsistent on training settings: batch size 4 (Sec. 3.1.1) vs 12 (Table S7), 350 epochs (Sec. 3.1.2, Table S7) vs 300 epochs per seed (SI), force-outlier cutoff 8 eV/A (text) vs 10 eV/A (SI); none of these values is encoded. Correlation order 3 of Table S7 is encoded as bodyOrder 3, as for nu_max elsewhere.
# - Relative lattice energies (Fig. 5), RMSDs of optimised structures (Table 2), energy conservation, RDFs and P2 order parameters are not error metrics and are not encoded. MACE-MPA-0 is not a registry model, so it is a paper-local run.
# - Acridine has no verified Wikidata QID in the snapshot, so none is attached.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/lahouari2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
